    "LiveContainer can notify you when a refresh starts, completes, or needs attention. Nothing runs differently if you skip this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer can notify you when a refresh starts, completes, or needs attention. Nothing runs differently if you skip this."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer יכול להודיע על התחלת רענון, סיומו או צורך בטיפול. דילוג על שלב זה לא משנה את אופן הפעולה."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 可以在刷新开始、完成或需要处理时通知你。跳过此步骤不会改变任何运行行为。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 可以在重新整理開始、完成或需要處理時通知你。略過此步驟不會改變任何執行行為。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer could not confirm the pairing-file state. Reload status before treating setup as complete.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer could not confirm the pairing-file state. Reload status before treating setup as complete."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח לאשר את מצב קובץ הצימוד. יש לטעון מחדש את המצב לפני התייחסות להגדרה כאל פעולה שהושלמה."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法确认配对文件状态。请重新加载状态后，再判断设置是否完成。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法確認配對檔案狀態。請重新載入狀態後，再判斷設定是否完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer could not create access to its internal shared SideStore folder. Check that the App Group container is available; copy diagnostics if the folder still cannot be accessed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer could not create access to its internal shared SideStore folder. Check that the App Group container is available; copy diagnostics if the folder still cannot be accessed."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח ליצור גישה לתיקיית SideStore הפנימית המשותפת שלו. יש לוודא שמכל קבוצת היישומים זמין; אם עדיין לא ניתן לגשת לתיקייה, יש להעתיק את פרטי האבחון."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法建立对其内部共享 SideStore 文件夹的访问。请检查 App 群组容器是否可用；如果仍无法访问该文件夹，请复制诊断信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法建立對其內部共享 SideStore 資料夾的存取。請檢查 App 群組容器是否可用；如果仍無法存取該資料夾，請複製診斷資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer could not open its shared refresh store, so scheduled refresh state is unavailable in this launch. Refresh All still works.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer could not open its shared refresh store, so scheduled refresh state is unavailable in this launch. Refresh All still works."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח לפתוח את מאגר הרענון המשותף שלו, ולכן מצב הרענון המתוזמן אינו זמין בהפעלה זו. האפשרות 'רענון הכול' עדיין פועלת."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法打开共享刷新存储，因此本次启动中无法获取定时刷新状态。仍可使用“全部刷新”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法開啟共享重新整理儲存，因此本次啟動中無法取得排程重新整理狀態。仍可使用「全部重新整理」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer could not open the shared store it uses with the embedded SideStore service.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer could not open the shared store it uses with the embedded SideStore service."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח לפתוח את המאגר המשותף שבו הוא משתמש עם שירות SideStore המוטמע."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法打开它与内嵌 SideStore 服务共用的存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法開啟它與內嵌 SideStore 服務共用的儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer could not open the shared store that its refresh state and the embedded SideStore service both use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer could not open the shared store that its refresh state and the embedded SideStore service both use."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח לפתוח את המאגר המשותף שמשמש את מצב הרענון שלו ואת שירות SideStore המוטמע."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法打开其刷新状态与内嵌 SideStore 服务共用的存储。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法開啟其重新整理狀態與內嵌 SideStore 服務共用的儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer could not read its previous installed profile, so a background refresh cannot be confirmed as having renewed it. Open Refresh History for details.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer could not read its previous installed profile, so a background refresh cannot be confirmed as having renewed it. Open Refresh History for details."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח לקרוא את הפרופיל הקודם שהותקן בו, ולכן לא ניתן לאשר שרענון ברקע חידש אותו. לפרטים יש לפתוח את היסטוריית הרענונים."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法读取之前安装的描述文件，因此无法确认后台刷新是否已将其续期。请打开“刷新历史记录”查看详细信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法讀取之前安裝的描述檔，因此無法確認背景重新整理是否已將其續期。請開啟「重新整理歷史記錄」查看詳細資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer could not read or prepare the selected pairing file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer could not read or prepare the selected pairing file."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח לקרוא או להכין את קובץ הצימוד שנבחר."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法读取或准备所选配对文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法讀取或準備所選配對檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer has no JIT-Less certificate copy yet. Import one to launch guest apps on this iOS version.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer has no JIT-Less certificate copy yet. Import one to launch guest apps on this iOS version."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ל-LiveContainer עדיין אין עותק של תעודת חתימה למצב ללא JIT. יש לייבא עותק כדי להפעיל יישומים מתארחים בגרסת iOS זו."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 尚无 JIT-Less 证书副本。请导入证书，以在此 iOS 版本上启动客体应用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 尚無 JIT-Less 憑證副本。請匯入憑證，以在此 iOS 版本上啟動客體應用程式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer received results for a different refresh attempt. This attempt could not be verified. Review Refresh history and app expiration; explicitly retry only after the previous attempt finishes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer received results for a different refresh attempt. This attempt could not be verified. Review Refresh history and app expiration; explicitly retry only after the previous attempt finishes."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer קיבל תוצאות של ניסיון רענון אחר. לא ניתן לאמת ניסיון זה. יש לעיין בהיסטוריית הרענונים ובתוקף היישומים; יש ליזום ניסיון חוזר רק לאחר סיום הניסיון הקודם."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 收到了另一次刷新尝试的结果。无法验证此次尝试。请查看刷新历史记录和应用到期时间；仅在上一次尝试完成后手动重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 收到了另一次重新整理嘗試的結果。無法驗證此次嘗試。請查看重新整理歷史記錄和應用程式到期時間；僅在上一次嘗試完成後手動重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer refreshed its installed profile, but the new one could not be confirmed until you relaunch. Relaunch to finish verifying it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer refreshed its installed profile, but the new one could not be confirmed until you relaunch. Relaunch to finish verifying it."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer רענן את הפרופיל המותקן שלו, אך לא ניתן לאשר את הפרופיל החדש עד להפעלה מחדש. יש להפעיל מחדש כדי להשלים את האימות."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 已刷新安装的描述文件，但只有重新启动后才能确认新描述文件。请重新启动以完成验证。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 已重新整理安裝的描述檔，但只有重新啟動後才能確認新描述檔。請重新啟動以完成驗證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer refreshed, but its installed profile has not advanced yet. Relaunch LiveContainer, then check Refresh History.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer refreshed, but its installed profile has not advanced yet. Relaunch LiveContainer, then check Refresh History."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer רוענן, אך הפרופיל המותקן שלו עדיין לא התחדש. יש להפעיל מחדש את LiveContainer ואז לבדוק את היסטוריית הרענונים."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 已刷新，但已安装的描述文件尚未续期。请重新启动 LiveContainer，然后检查刷新历史记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 已重新整理，但已安裝的描述檔尚未續期。請重新啟動 LiveContainer，然後檢查重新整理歷史記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiveContainer was unable to move the data of shared app back because LiveContainer cannot access app group. Please check JITLess diagnose page in LiveContainer settings for more information.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer was unable to move the data of shared app back because LiveContainer cannot access app group. Please check JITLess diagnose page in LiveContainer settings for more information."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer לא הצליח להעביר בחזרה את נתוני היישום המשותף מפני שאין לו גישה לקבוצת היישומים. למידע נוסף יש לבדוק את דף האבחון של המצב ללא JIT בהגדרות LiveContainer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 无法访问 App 群组，因此无法将共享应用的数据移回。请查看 LiveContainer 设置中的 JITLess 诊断页面以了解详细信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiveContainer 無法存取 App 群組，因此無法將共享應用程式的資料移回。請查看 LiveContainer 設定中的 JITLess 診斷頁面以瞭解詳細資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
