    "That action did not complete, and whether it took effect is not known. Reload status to see the current state before trying again. If it keeps failing, copy diagnostics to identify the cause.\nError ID: SS-CMD-C11": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That action did not complete, and whether it took effect is not known. Reload status to see the current state before trying again. If it keeps failing, copy diagnostics to identify the cause.\nError ID: SS-CMD-C11"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "הפעולה לא הושלמה, ולא ידוע אם בוצע שינוי. לפני ניסיון נוסף, יש לטעון מחדש את המצב כדי לראות את המצב הנוכחי. אם הכשל חוזר, יש להעתיק את פרטי האבחון כדי לזהות את הסיבה.\nמזהה שגיאה: SS-CMD-C11"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作未完成，且是否已生效尚不清楚。请重新加载状态以查看当前状态，然后再试。如果持续失败，请复制诊断信息以确定原因。\n错误 ID：SS-CMD-C11"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作未完成，且是否已生效尚不清楚。請重新載入狀態以查看目前狀態，然後再試。如果持續失敗，請複製診斷資訊以確定原因。\n錯誤 ID：SS-CMD-C11"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That action did not complete.\nError ID: SS-CMD-C11": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That action did not complete.\nError ID: SS-CMD-C11"
