    "What happened: SideStore could not reach the configured Anisette server.\nWhat you can do: Check its address and your network, then try again. This does not show that LocalDevVPN is unavailable.\n%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What happened: SideStore could not reach the configured Anisette server.\nWhat you can do: Check its address and your network, then try again. This does not show that LocalDevVPN is unavailable.\n%@"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "מה קרה: SideStore לא הצליח להגיע לשרת Anisette שהוגדר.\nמה אפשר לעשות: לבדוק את הכתובת ואת הרשת ולנסות שוב. אין בכך הוכחה לכך ש-LocalDevVPN אינו זמין.\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发生了什么：SideStore 无法连接配置的 Anisette 服务器。\n你可以怎么做：检查服务器地址和网络，然后重试。这并不表示 LocalDevVPN 不可用。\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發生了甚麼：SideStore 無法連線設定的 Anisette 伺服器。\n你可以怎麼做：檢查伺服器地址和網路，然後重試。這並不表示 LocalDevVPN 不可用。\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happened: The Anisette Servers request was cancelled.\nWhat you can do: Reopen Anisette Servers to check the current state before trying again.\n%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What happened: The Anisette Servers request was cancelled.\nWhat you can do: Reopen Anisette Servers to check the current state before trying again.\n%@"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "מה קרה: הבקשה לשרתי Anisette בוטלה.\nמה אפשר לעשות: לפתוח מחדש את 'שרתי Anisette' ולבדוק את המצב הנוכחי לפני ניסיון נוסף.\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发生了什么：Anisette 服务器请求已取消。\n你可以怎么做：重新打开“Anisette 服务器”，检查当前状态后再试。\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發生了甚麼：Anisette 伺服器請求已取消。\n你可以怎麼做：重新開啟「Anisette 伺服器」，檢查目前狀態後再試。\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
