          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前連線可能仍正常。請重試一次。如果再次發生，請開啟連線設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your device is currently mounting the developer disk image. Leave your device on and connected. Once this finishes, you can run JitStreamer again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your device is currently mounting the developer disk image. Leave your device on and connected. Once this finishes, you can run JitStreamer again."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "המכשיר מעגן כעת את דמות הדיסק למפתחים. יש להשאיר אותו מופעל ומחובר. לאחר סיום התהליך אפשר להפעיל שוב את JitStreamer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备正在挂载开发者磁盘映像。请保持设备开机并连接。完成后，即可再次运行 JitStreamer。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置正在掛載開發者磁碟映像。請保持裝置開機並連線。完成後，即可再次執行 JitStreamer。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your response could not be delivered to the embedded service through the secure channel, so it was never sent to Apple. This is not an authentication failure.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your response could not be delivered to the embedded service through the secure channel, so it was never sent to Apple. This is not an authentication failure."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "לא ניתן למסור את התגובה שלך לשירות המוטמע דרך הערוץ המאובטח, ולכן היא מעולם לא נשלחה ל-Apple. זה אינו כשל באימות."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的响应无法通过安全通道递送至内嵌服务，因此从未发送给 Apple。这不是身份验证失败。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回應無法透過安全通道傳送至內嵌服務，因此從未傳送給 Apple。這不是身分驗證失敗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your response is being processed...": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your response is being processed..."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "התגובה שלך מעובדת..."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在处理你的响应..."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在處理你的回應..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your response never left this device, so no Apple password was sent. Re-sign or reinstall LiveContainer so its embedded service shares the app's secure storage group, then submit the response again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your response never left this device, so no Apple password was sent. Re-sign or reinstall LiveContainer so its embedded service shares the app's secure storage group, then submit the response again."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "התגובה שלך מעולם לא יצאה מהמכשיר, ולכן לא נשלחה סיסמת Apple. יש לחתום מחדש על LiveContainer או להתקין אותו מחדש כדי שהשירות המוטמע ישתף את קבוצת האחסון המאובטח של היישום, ואז לשלוח שוב את התגובה."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的响应从未离开此设备，因此未发送任何 Apple 密码。请重新签名或重新安装 LiveContainer，使其内嵌服务共享应用的安全存储群组，然后再次提交响应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的回應從未離開此裝置，因此未傳送任何 Apple 密碼。請重新簽署或重新安裝 LiveContainer，使其內嵌服務共享應用程式的安全儲存群組，然後再次提交回應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
